  :at "2026-07-22T06:21:46Z"
  (given claim-v1-f1)
  (normally r-cl-state-v1-f1 claim-v1-f1 state-claimed-v1-f1)
  (normally r-cl-chain-v1-f1 state-claimed-v1-f1 claimed-f1)
)

